{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e72195129a5da2feb605977f32a5eecef1ecf92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(x) = f(g(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885751698c023c14f90eadc69c167ed7fe9fd26e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h&#39;(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be511967ce00d1a440b2f99f99cf31dc7a48a243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1ce1ad598a9a7473c28718ee4630ce0b8cce1e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g&#39;(1) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/0/f30ddcaee8ab383f7aff4ad680310002f3f7e1f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9eab0f8fb59af74d4de0fa6acfab37072561a0d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f&#39;(2) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p>\t\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c83eceaddde775cc9d89b09e92643d8a659ffa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 20  \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(B) } 6  \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(C) } 10  \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(D) } 12  \\quad \t\t\t\\textbf{(E) } 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"325\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the chain rule, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c915effb3e96e9de66207410d241d2336ac888e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h&#39;(x) = f&#39;(g(x))\\cdot g&#39;(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6c7e13f7836a7d06fe1236199c7343686f33fba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h&#39;(1) = f&#39;(g(1))\\cdot g&#39;(1) = f&#39;(2) \\cdot 3 = 5 \\cdot 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) 15}}\\]\" width=\"404\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" ro